meta {
  name: API info (liveness)
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Liveness + version probe, the equivalent of the wait loop
  run-live-lanes.sh runs before proofing. Not a path the connector code
  consumes (the proof reads only authenticate + /agents) - it exists so a
  reviewer can distinguish "manager down" from "credential wrong" before
  blaming the evidence read. Returns api_version/revision.
}
